  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">4월 7일 파종 (품종은 4종류!)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5870b4b4dd1b48240b2089fea49192e2557b9796\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5870b4b4dd1b48240b2089fea49192e2557b9796\" data-origin-width=\"2016\" data-origin-height=\"1512\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e60d85b14270968e2265b7cbb5107c291656c390\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e60d85b14270968e2265b7cbb5107c291656c390\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br><br><br>파종 7일 후 (4월 14일) 새싹 올라옴<br>토종노랑완두 4/14 새싹나옴<br>토종보라완두 4/17 새싹나옴<br>몽골노랑완두 4/19 새싹나옴<br>몽골초록완두 4/19 새싹나옴</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83cc43f4592ae12d8fa0066f27f0884f6c11e37e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83cc43f4592ae12d8fa0066f27f0884f6c11e37e\" data-origin-width=\"1257\" data-origin-height=\"1008\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br><br>파종 한 달 후(5/6) 성장속도 차이<br>토종노랑이 눈에띄게 빨리 자라고 나머지는 비슷</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/245c19c664b9141731366b850fc2f783feb1ef2d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/245c19c664b9141731366b850fc2f783feb1ef2d\" data-origin-width=\"2896\" data-origin-height=\"2896\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br><br>5/11 지주대 설치<br>지주대는 미리 설치하거나 처음부터 화단의 철망쪽에 심어도 좋음</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a199c90e268103a5f146ed5e62c13deb59e00d2b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a199c90e268103a5f146ed5e62c13deb59e00d2b\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c84f04b947a07ff601f620fc13dada003bc86fb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c84f04b947a07ff601f620fc13dada003bc86fb\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>파종 40일 후(5/17) 꽃이 피기 시작<br>토종 노랑완두(보리콩)에만 하얀 꽃이 피기 시작함<br>꽃봉오리 상태에는 좀 노랗게 보이지만 피고 나면 흰색다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f698a89e037efd78a7170e554436866460b3800d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f698a89e037efd78a7170e554436866460b3800d\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3987faae458c510b871773c25ee41a864c6b7db6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3987faae458c510b871773c25ee41a864c6b7db6\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>시중에 구할 수 있는 완두 품종들은 그야말로 품종이기 때문에 거의 순종이다. 따라서 P세대를 심은 상태이고<br>타가수분을 통하여 F1세대를 얻기까지가 올해의 목표이다.<br>(겨울에 심어 봄에 씨앗을 얻는 것은 하우스가 없으면 힘드므로 F2세대는 다음해에..)<br><br>※완두를 비롯한 콩류는 꽃이 개화하는 날 99% 자가수분된다.<br>※암술의 수정능력 : 개화전 24시간~개화후 48시간<br>※수술의 수정능력 : 개화 후 2~4시간(개화는 보통 늦은 아침에 일어난다)<br>=&gt; 따라서 전체적으로 꽃이 반정도는 봉우리상태, 반 정도는 개화한 상태일 때 아침에 타가수분을 하기에 가장 적당할 것이다.<br><br>*꽃의 구조와 수정능력<br><a href=\"http://www.bokjitimes.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=9433\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://www.bokjitimes.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=9433</a></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br>*실험과정 설명<br><a href=\"http://webbuild1.knu.ac.kr/~bskim/pea1.htm\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://webbuild1.knu.ac.kr/~bskim/pea1.htm</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">*타가수분방법 설명영상☆<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/Pq7-JGRmFBc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/Pq7-JGRmFBc</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Pq7-JGRmFBc&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cSlI7s/hyKe4pwPfy/eNZKM5MBnA8WEJkgaiDaN0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Pq7-JGRmFBc\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size16\"><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
